  message: "Merged in dev as 5d12965980. PhoenixStrategy extends MethodNameStrategy with new extract_class_method hook for Elixir's Module.function shape; covers Phoenix 1.x (lib/my_app_web/templates/user/show.html.{eex,heex,leex}) and 1.7+ (lib/my_app_web/controllers/user_html/show.html.heex) layouts including namespaced controllers and the UserHTML function-component shape. 21 new tests, 100% coverage. WI-hogik and WI-hokaj independent of this; both can proceed against the shared core."  # b1f8
